<div class="theorem" data-kind="theorem" id="thm:fermat">
<p><span class="theorem-head"><span class="theorem-name">Theorem 1</span> <span class="theorem-title">(Fermat’s little theorem)</span>.</span> If <math><mi>p</mi></math> is prime, then <math><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>≡</mo><mi>a</mi><mspace width="0.44444445em"/><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mspace/><mi>mod</mi></mrow><mspace width="0.33333334em"/><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></math>.</p>
</div>
<div class="proof">
<p><span class="proof-head">Proof.</span> By induction on <math><mi>a</mi></math>:</p>
<math display="block"><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>≡</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>
<p class="qed"><span class="qed" role="img" aria-label="End of proof">∎</span></p>
</div>
<div class="theorem key" data-kind="lemma" id="lem:zorn">
<p><span class="theorem-head"><span class="theorem-name">Lemma 2</span> <span class="theorem-title">(Zorn, for <math><mi>ω</mi></math>)</span>.</span></p>
<math display="block"><mi>x</mi></math>
<p>Every chain has an upper bound.</p>
</div>
<div class="proof">
<p><span class="proof-head">Proof of the lemma.</span></p>
<ul>
<li>one</li>
<li>two</li>
</ul>
<p class="qed"><span class="qed" role="img" aria-label="End of proof">∎</span></p>
</div>
<div class="theorem" data-kind="remark">
<p><span class="theorem-head"><span class="theorem-name">Remark</span>.</span> A remark.</p>
</div>
<div class="proof">
<p><span class="proof-head">Proof.</span> Short. <span class="qed" role="img" aria-label="End of proof">∎</span></p>
</div>
<div class="aside">
<p>Not a kind.</p>
</div>
